      "content": "it seems like a lot of people get bells palsy and just take some steroids and they're fine. i don't really have time to go to the doctor right now or wait in an ER. do you think it's definitely more likely to be the palsy thing than a stroke or something? it doesn't feel like a stroke, i don't feel dizzy or anything.",
